::msgcat::mcset cy "You are about to commit on a detached head. This is a potentially dangerous thing to do because if you switch to another branch you will lose your changes and it can be difficult to retrieve them later from the reflog. You should probably cancel this commit and create a new branch to continue.\n \n Do you really want to proceed with your Commit?" "Rydych chi am wneud ymrwymiad ar ben wedi'i ddatgysylltu. Mae hyn yn beth posib beryglus i'w wneud oherwydd os byddwch chi'n newid i gangen arall, byddwch chi'n colli eich newidiadau ac efallai y bydd yn anodd eu hadalw yn nes ymlaen o'r reflog. Dylech chi efallai ganslo'r ymrwymiad hwn a chreu cangen newydd i barhau.\n \n Ydych chi wir eisiau parhau gyda'ch Ymchwiliad?"
