::msgcat::mcset cy "You are in the middle of a conflicted merge.\n\nFile %s has merge conflicts.\n\nYou must resolve them, stage the file, and commit to complete the current merge.  Only then can you begin another merge.\n" "Rydych yng nghanol uno gyda gwrthdaro.\n\nMae gan ffeil %s wrthdaro mewn uno.\n\nMae’n rhaid i chi eu datrys, camu'r ffeil, a gwneud ymrwymiad i gwblhau'r uno presennol. Dim ond wedyn y gallwch ddechrau uno arall."
